# Feralas (45-46): the Horde quests of Camp Mojache, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/feralas_45_46.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Feralas, area 357).
# The guide's quest list is section 8 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md; the higher
# Feralas quests are in Feralas & Un'Goro Crater (49-50).
# Carried in: On the Other Side (95033), taken from Tan'jani in Rog'mar, Riverglades.
# Deadmire (1205) and Mirrorscale (97378) come from Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff: Deadmire is a
# crocolisk of Dustwallow Marsh, so the guide flies there before it goes to Feralas, and Mirrorscale
# (its follow-up) is a wind serpent of the Forgotten Coast.
# Rescue OOX-22/FE! (2767) is handed in to Oglethorpe in Booty Bay: the guide ends there, in
# Stranglethorn Vale, where the next guide begins.
# No auction house stop: none of the quest items is sold there.
#
# The route: the zeppelin to Orgrimmar; Thunder Bluff; a flight to Brackenwall for Deadmire and back;
# Freewind Post and the ride west to Camp Mojache; four loops from the camp (the ogres and gnolls to
# the north, the Grimtotem camps and the Woodpaw alphas, the gnoll battle plans, then the Zukk'ash
# hive, the southern Gordunni, Feral Scar Vale, OOX-22/FE and Mirrorscale on the coast); Thunder
# Bluff and Orgrimmar to hand in and train; the zeppelin to Grom'gol and Booty Bay.

guide Feralas (45-46)
faction horde
levels 45 46
carry 1118 2741 3520 95033 95295 95296
leave 1118 2741 3520 95295 95296
next Stranglethorn Vale (46-47)

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Durotar
note "Take the zeppelin to Durotar: from the tower outside Undercity, or from Grom'gol in Stranglethorn Vale" at 50.8,13.4
map Orgrimmar
accept 2981
tip Belgrom Rockmaul stands in the Valley of Honor.
fly "Thunder Bluff, Mulgore" npc 3310

# Thunder Bluff and Dustwallow Marsh: Deadmire -------------------------------------------------------

map Thunder Bluff
accept 1205
tip Melor Stonehoof is on Hunter Rise.
fly "Brackenwall Village" npc 2995
map Dustwallow Marsh
do 1205
tip Deadmire, an old level 45 crocolisk, wades through the pools south-east of Brackenwall Village.
fly "Thunder Bluff, Mulgore" npc 11899
map Thunder Bluff
turnin 1205
accept 97378

# To Camp Mojache -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Freewind Post" npc 2995
tip If you already know Camp Mojache, fly straight there. Without Freewind Post, fly to Camp Taurajo and ride south into Thousand Needles.
map Feralas
goto "Ride west out of Thousand Needles along the road into Feralas, to Camp Mojache" at 75.5,44.4 r 30
fpath 8020
turnin 95033
accept 3121
tip Keep the Shrunken Head: Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar wants it, at the end of the guide.
turnin 2981 at 75.8,43.6
tip Rok Orhan wanders around the camp in red armor.
accept 2975 at 75.8,43.6
accept 2987
accept 92878
tip Blaise Montgomery cannot speak: he lost his jaw to the Grimtotem.
accept 2973
accept 2862
accept 2822
bind 7737

