tip The Woodpaw camp just north of Camp Mojache is the nearest; every Woodpaw gnoll can drop a mane.
do 2975.1 bg
do 2975.2 bg
do 2975.3 bg at 77.6,33.9
do 2987
tip Use Orwin's Shovel on the Gordunni Dirt Mounds among the ogres.
accept 2978 at 75.1,29.7 "Pick up the Gordunni Scroll lying in the ogre camp and read it"
tip Scrolls also lie at 74.5,27.9 and 80.5,34.3.
do 2975.1
do 2975.2
do 2975.3 at 77.6,33.9
do 92878
tip Namida Grimtotem, a level 43 elite druid, walks through the Grimtotem camp north-west of Camp Mojache.
do 2973
tip The Sprite Darters flutter over the grass west of Camp Mojache; the Captured Sprite Darters in the Grimtotem camp drop them too.

