# The Zukk'ash hive, the southern Gordunni, Feral Scar Vale and the coast ----------------------------

do 7730 bg
do 7731
do 2741 at 57.1,76.3 icon pickup "Take a Hippogryph Egg from the nests (for the Super Egg-O-Matic)"
tip Only if you have The Super Egg-O-Matic from Gadgetzan; otherwise skip it.
tip Stinglasher, a level 47 wasp, crawls in the Writhing Deep, the tunnels of the Zukk'ash hive south of Camp Mojache.
do 7730
do 2979 bg
do 2980.1
tip The shamans, warlocks and mage-lords hold the Gordunni camp in the south-west.
do 2980.2
do 2979
tip Only the Gordunni Mage-Lords drop the orb, and not often: each of you needs one.
do 2980.3
tip The maulers guard the ogre camp further north, with more warlocks.
do 2822
tip The yetis of Feral Scar Vale drop a thick hide one time in four.
accept 2766
tip The OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon is a rare drop of almost any mob in Feralas. Only one of you found it? Share the quest. Neither? Skip the OOX-22/FE steps, here and in Booty Bay.
turnin 2766
