accept 2767
do 2767 at 45.6,43.4 icon text "Escort OOX-22/FE to the dock on the Forgotten Coast"
tip Start the escort only when both of you have the quest. Ambushes wait along the way.
do 3520 bg
tip Screecher Spirits: when a Screecher is almost dead, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on it to capture its spirit (only if you have the quest).
do 97378
tip Mirrorscale, a level 48 wind serpent, lairs below the waterfall near the dock.
